# Regular expressions read automatically by lychee from the repository root.
# Each entry is a URL that answers 403 to automated checkers while still working
# in a browser. Verify a candidate manually before adding it, and remove the
# entry once the host accepts automated requests again.

# GitHub returns 403 Forbidden for non-interactive clients on the signup page.
^https://github\.com/signup$

# The reference site sits behind a CDN that rejects link-checker requests.
^https://agenticdevopsplatform\.ai/?$
